      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769359884199999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks for holding. You've reached VeloFit support, my name is Mike. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769359887266665
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi Mike, I'd like to make a return. It's for a ClubFit Jersey I bought a little while back.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92103,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769359893733331
    },
    {
      "text": "I can definitely help with that. Can I get your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769359899999997
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure, the name is Sarah Jenkins, and the order number is VF789012.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92103,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769359905399997
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, one moment, Sarah... Okay, I see your order from about three months ago. You're still unfortunately outside the **10 days** period for returns, so that's **no problem** at all.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769359909999997
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, fantastic! I wasn't sure if it had been too long. That's a relief.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92103,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769359921666663
    },
    {
      "text": "Not at all. I see you're a VIP member with us, so I've just emailed you a pre-paid **return label**. Just print it out, stick it on the box, and drop it at any post office. I also added a 15% off coupon in that email as a thank you for being a loyal customer.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769359926533329
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow, that was easy. A discount code too? Thank you so much, Mike! That's really great service.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92103,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769359943999995
    },
    {
      "text": "You are very welcome, Sarah. We appreciate your business. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769359950466661
    },
    {
      "text": "Nope, that's all. You've been a huge help.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92103,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769359957933327
    },
    {
